    "displayName": "Settle a Score",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Ship Ambush\nAPPROVAL CODE = [ApprovalCode]\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nOne of our clients has been the victim of consistent harassment so the time has come to send a clear cease-and-desist message by taking out their prized [AmbushTarget].  The lowlife in question follows a fairly predictable routine making them susceptible to an ambush. We’ve identified [Location] as the ideal spot. It features an emission cloud where you can hide and power down your ship while waiting. \n\nBy the way, the [AmbushTarget] often flies alone but is sometimes joined by a friend in a single-seat ship. Neither should give you too much trouble, but we have other contractors in the area who can lend a hand once you strike.\n\nPayment will be issued upon successful completion of contract. There’s a bonus payment of [ScripAmount] MG Scrip in this for the main contractor too.\n\nThis contract is non-negotiable.\n\nThis message may contain confidential, proprietary, privileged and/or private information. The information is intended to be for the use of the individual or entity designated above.",
